wo goals and two assists in two games for Germany.","copyright":"IMAGO\u002FDeFodi.de","credit":"","src":"https:\u002F\u002Fassets.bundesliga.com\u002Fcontender\u002F2026\u002F10\u002Fimago1086023955h.jpg?crop=0px%2C312px%2C6000px%2C3375px"},"mobile":{"alt":"Brajan Gruda Deutschland celebrates after scoring his team s fifth goal during the UEFA Nations League 2026\u002F27 group phase match between Germany and Netherlands at Olympiastadion on November 16, 2026 in Berlin, Germany. Photo by Mario Hommes\u002FDeFodi Images - *** Brajan Gruda of Germany celebrates after scoring his team s fifth goal during the UEFA Nations League 202627 group stage match between Germany and the Netherlands at the Olympiastadion on November 16, 2026, in Berlin, Germany. Photo by Mario Hommes, DeFodi Images","caption":"Brajan Gruda has two goals and two assists in two games for Germany.","copyright":"IMAGO\u002FDeFodi.de","credit":"","src":"https:\u002F\u002Fassets.bundesliga.com\u002Fcontender\u002F2026\u002F10\u002Fimago1086023955h.jpg?crop=625px%2C225px%2C4583px%2C3666px"}},{"type":"embed","embedPlatform":"x","snipped":"\u003Cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\">\u003Cp lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">The definition of a 𝒃𝙖𝒍𝙡𝒆𝙧 😮‍💨 \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Ft.co\u002F32GMMruy6Y\">pic.twitter.com\u002F32GMMruy6Y\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>&mdash; RB Leipzig English (@RBLeipzig_EN) \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fx.com\u002FRBLeipzig_EN\u002Fstatus\u002F2122615280605995208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">November 17, 2026\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fblockquote>\n\u003Cscript async src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fplatform.x.com\u002Fwidgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\">\u003C\u002Fscript>\n\n","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fx.com\u002FRBLeipzig_EN\u002Fstatus\u002F2122615280605995208"}],"meta":{"canonical":"flourishing-brajan-gruda-shining-for-both-rb-leipzig-and-germany","description":"Brajan Gruda has been in scintillating form for RB Leipzig this season and has become one of the first names on Martín Demichelis’ team sheets. Enjoying a rapid rise, the newly capped Germany international shows no signs of slowing down…","keywords":[],"openGraph":{"description":"Brajan Gruda has been in scintillating form for RB Leipzig this season and has become one of the first names on Martín Demichelis’ team sheets. Enjoying a rapid rise, the newly capped Germany international shows no signs of slowing down…","image":"https:\u002F\u002Fassets.bundesliga.com\u002Fcontender\u002F2026\u002F10\u002Fimago1085774036h.jpg?crop=491px%2C83px%2C4099px%2C2307px","title":"Brajan Gruda: Sky is the limit for RB Leipzig and Germany's 'street footballer'","url":"https:\u002F\u002FTODO - we need the url structure!"},"title":"Brajan Gruda: Sky is the limit for RB Leipzig and Germany's 'street footballer'","x":{"card":"summary_large_image","creator":"@bundesliga_en","description":"Brajan Gruda has been in scintillating form for RB Leipzig this season and has become one of the first names on Martín Demichelis’ team sheets. Enjoying a rapid rise, the newly capped Germany international shows no signs of slowing down…","image":"https:\u002F\u002Fassets.bundesliga.com\u002Fcontender\u002F2026\u002F10\u002Fimago1085774036h.jpg?crop=491px%2C83px%2C4099px%2C2307px","site":"@bundesliga_en","title":"Brajan Gruda: Sky is the limit for RB Leipzig and Germany's 'street footballer'"}},"paragraphs":[{"type":"paragraph","body":["\u003Cp>The youngster is, of course, no stranger to Germany’s top flight, having debuted in the division for \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fclubs\u002F1-fsv-mainz-05\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-000006\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Mainz\u003C\u002Fa> as an 18-year-old against \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fclubs\u002Fborussia-dortmund\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-000007\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Borussia Dortmund\u003C\u002Fa> in 2023, before switching to English Premier League side Brighton and Hove Albion the following year, where he returned four goals in 45 appearances across all competitions.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>Upon returning to Germany in February 2026, \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fplayer\u002Fbrajan-gruda\" data-dfl-object-id=\"DFL-OBJ-J01ND7\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-000017\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Gruda\u003C\u002Fa> recorded three goals and as many assists in 13 Bundesliga appearances under Ole Werner – enough to prompt \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fclubs\u002Frb-leipzig\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-000017\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Leipzig\u003C\u002Fa> into extending the player’s loan for the 2026\u002F27 campaign. Now an invaluable asset as \u003Cem>Die Roten Bullen\u003C\u002Fem> challenge on all fronts after returning to UEFA Champions League football, Gruda is one of the Bundesliga’s next breakout stars.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Watch: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cem>Gruda's best bits\u003C\u002Fem>\u003C\u002Fp>"],"headline":""},{"type":"paragraph","body":["\u003Cp>Continuing his upward trajectory, the 22-year-old has started six of his seven Bundesliga appearances this term, returning \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fstats\u002Fplayers\u002Fassists\">four assists\u003C\u002Fa>, two of which came in Leipzig’s \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fnews\u002Frb-leipzig-augsburg-match-report-highlights-matchday-9-39921\">5-2 thrashing\u003C\u002Fa> of \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fclubs\u002Ffc-augsburg\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-000010\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Augsburg\u003C\u002Fa> and earned him the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fnews\u002Fofficial-man-of-the-match-winners-2026-27-adidas-kane-olise-38856\">Man of the Match\u003C\u002Fa> award. “Brajan’s performance was outstanding,” remarked \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fplayer\u002Fmartin-demichelis\" data-dfl-object-id=\"DFL-OBJ-0029ZZ\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-000017\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Demichelis\u003C\u002Fa>, whose charges sit fourth after nine games, three points behind leaders \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fclubs\u002Ffc-bayern-muenchen\" data-dfl-club-id=\"DFL-CLU-00000G\" data-dfl-competition-id=\"DFL-COM-000001\" data-dfl-season-id=\"DFL-SEA-0001KA\">Bayern Munich\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003Cstrong>\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Watch:\u003C\u002Fstrong> \u003Cem>RB Leipzig 5-2 Augsburg\u003C\u002Fem>\u003C\u002Fp>"],"headline":""},{"type":"paragraph","body":["\u003Cp>Occupying the space left by Yan Diomande - who joined Real Madrid - on the right, Gruda’s fearless dribbling, low centre of gravity and wand of a left foot often leaves opposing defences in his wake. He has successfully dribbled past an opponent 27 times this season, which is the most by any player in the Bundesliga.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>“I played the way I always play,” Gruda said after the Augsburg match. “I think dribbling is simply in my blood. I had so much fun out there.” Playing with a smile on his face, the youngster’s performances this season has seen his services called upon by Germany head coach Jürgen Klopp.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>Although forced to withdraw from the September\u002FOctober international break through injury, Gruda soon made up for lost time when he earned his Germany bow against Serbia in November, netting his country’s third with a superb solo goal.\u003C\u002Fp>"],"headline":""},{"type":"paragraph","body":["\u003Cp>“Brajan is an exceptional talent; he has exceptional ability. The way he mixed things up today, playing simple passes before taking risks again – it was really lovely to watch,” Klopp said in Serbia.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>Recapping his debut goal, Gruda explained: “It was instinct. I don’t think too much when I’m dribbling with the ball. I just do it. It just happens.” A standout performance in Serbia, the attacker earned successive starts and netted Germany’s fifth in their rout of the Netherlands to secure their UEFA Nations League quarter-final berth and, what’s more, his four goal involvements (two goals, two assists) in two appearances is more than any other Germany player in their first two senior international matches since their 2014 FIFA World Cup triumph.\u003C\u002Fp>"],"headline":""},{"type":"paragraph","body":["\u003Cp>Described as a “street footballer” and a “brilliant player to watch” by Klopp, Leipzig’s rising star gets fans off their seats. “He’s technically gifted, creative and quick, while his quality in the final third gives us another dimension in attack,” expressed Leipzig's managing director for sport, Marcel Schäfer, upon extending Gruda’s loan deal until the end of the season.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\u003Cp>A revelation for the Saxony club, three of Gruda’s four Bundesliga assists have come at the Red Bull Arena, where Leipzig remain unbeaten with five straight victories and in free-scoring form with 23 goals - no team has picked up more points than Demichelis’ side at home in 2026\u002F27.\u003C\u002Fp>"],"headline":""},{"type":"paragraph","body":["\u003Cp>Although Gruda is yet to find the net in the Bundesliga, it appears to only be a matter of time with goals in the Champions League and DFB Cup already. Indeed, that could come as soon as \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.bundesliga.com\u002Fen\u002Fbundesliga\u002Fmatchday\u002F2026-2027\u002F10\u002F1-fc-union-berlin-vs-rb-leipzig\u002Fliveticker\">Saturday's trip to Union Berlin\u003C\u002Fa> on Matchday 10 for the Bundesliga’s breakout star, who is brimming with confidence and flourishing for both club and now also country.\u003C\u002Fp>"],"headline":""}],"players":["DFL-OBJ-J01ND7"],"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T04:37:00Z","slug":"flourishing-brajan-gruda-shining-for-both-rb-leipzig-and-germany-40023","speakingUrl":"flourishing-brajan-gruda-shining-for-both-rb-leipzig-and-germany","summary":["Brajan Gruda, on loan at RB Leipzig, has started six of seven Bundesliga games this season.","He leads the Bundesliga with 27 successful dribbles and has four assists.","Two assists in the 5-2 win over Augsburg earned him the Man of the Match award.","Gruda scored on his Germany debut against Serbia and added another goal against the Netherlands.","Leipzig sit fourth, three points behind leaders Bayern Munich, and visit Union Berlin on Matchday 10."],"teaserAbstract":{"teaserAbstractDefault":"The Bundesliga's next breakout star and street footballer is shining for both club and country in 2026\u002F27.","teaserAbstractShort":"The Bundesliga's next breakout star and street footballer is shining for both club and country in 2026\u002F27."},"tracking":{"content_group":"Feature","no_ads":false,"no_index":false},"type":"news","teaser":"https:\u002F\u002Fassets.bundesliga.com\u002Fcontender\u002F2026\u002F10\u002Fimago1085774036h.jpg?crop=491px%2C83px%2C4099px%2C2307px"}]},"h":{},"s":200,"st":"OK","u":"https:\u002F\u002Fwapp.bapi.bundesliga.com\u002Feditorial?category=fixturesbl1&editorialtype=feature,news,live_match&pageSize=3&pageNumber=0","rt":"json"},"2222a1d584d7daff6ad54897b5e4ef0c6f5192d37912051db859f1199feb01d9":{"b":{"DFL-MAT-J0422F":{"de":{"highlightVideo":{"duration":146,"videoId":"ZwM48xNv"}},"dflDatalibraryCompetitionId":"DFL-COM-000001","dflDatalibraryMatchId":"DFL-MAT-J0422F","dflDatalibraryMatchdayId":"DFL-DAY-004C9Y","dflDatalibrarySeasonId":"DFL-SEA-0001K9","en":